Description: Terminal tabular data explorer — CSV/JSON/YAML/TOML/Parquet/Excel/SQLite
 viewer with filtering, sorting, pivot tables, and charts
 A fast, keyboard-driven terminal viewer for tabular data: CSV, TSV, JSON,
 JSONL, YAML, TOML, Parquet, Arrow, Excel, SQLite and DuckDB. Filtering,
 sorting, pivot tables, computed columns, statistics and charts. JSON, YAML and
 TOML open as a table over the parsed document, so nested data can be browsed,
 edited and converted between formats. Installs `tuitab` plus the aliases
 `ttab` and `ttb`.

